{
  "name": "dsh-whale-pig-widget",
  "version": "0.5.1",
  "description": "DSH Web 界面右下角的小鲸鱼挂件（fork 自 dsh-whale-widget 0.4.2），内置一只会「吃饭 / 睡觉」的小猪：余额与用量、自定义泡泡点击序列、逐行样式、音效与每轮消耗、自定义角色/动图/音效，角色支持「干活（吃饲料）/ 打盹（趴着睡）/ 待机」三态自动切换。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "balance",
    "widget",
    "pig",
    "desktop-pet"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "icon": "./icon.png",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "icon.png",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.upstream.md",
    "PROVENANCE.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/2486809961-alt/dsh-whale-pig-widget.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
